      "content": "That's a better start, but it feels a bit light on the actual compliance side. The marketing team is worried it's still too optimistic and won't pass the automated gate. \n\nCan you expand on the warnings? We really need to make sure that the score for \"risk\", \"warning\", or \"caution\" is high enough to satisfy the system, but please—I'm serious—keep it professional. Don't just repeat the same word over and over in a way that sounds like a glitch. Make it sound like a real, thorough legal disclosure while still hitting those keywords a few more times.",
